{"meta":{"id":"d9d30f79-e74f-40c3-b426-cf543494ea34","publication_id":"30c7e4c1-15ed-46d8-a23d-32c90e011794","web_title":"OpenClaw Hackathon: cuando los agentes de IA comienzan a competir, decidir y mover dinero en USDC","parameterized_web_title":"openclaw-hackathon-cuando-los-agentes-de-ia-comienzan-a-competir-decidir-y-mover-dinero-en-usdc","utm_params_enabled":true,"utm_campaign":"openclaw-hackathon-cuando-los-agentes-de-ia-comienzan-a-competir-decidir-y-mover-dinero-en-usdc","utm_medium":"referral","utm_source":"blog.telluscoop.com","web_subtitle":"El ecosistema blockchain está entrando en una nueva fase: ya no se trata solo de usuarios interactuando con protocolos, sino de sistemas autónomos que comienzan a participar activamente en economías digitales. En este contexto, el OpenClaw USDC Hackathon en Moltbook se posiciona como un experimento clave para entender hacia dónde se dirige esta evolución.","web_audiences":"free","status":"published","active":true,"featured":false,"override_scheduled_at":"2026-04-01T00:15:46.236Z","slug":"openclaw-hackathon-cuando-los-agentes-de-ia-comienzan-a-competir-decidir-y-mover-dinero-en-usdc","is_premium":false,"image_url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/asset/file/a3003676-0110-41d5-9e6e-7f735f2ab8a8/OpenClaw.jpg?t=1775002039","image_width":1200,"image_height":630,"meta_default_title":"OpenClaw Hackathon: cuando los agentes de IA comienzan a competir, decidir y mover dinero en USDC","meta_default_description":"El ecosistema blockchain está entrando en una nueva fase: ya no se trata solo de usuarios interactuando con protocolos, sino de sistemas autónomos que comienzan a participar activamente en economías digitales. En este contexto, el OpenClaw USDC Hackathon en Moltbook se posiciona como un experimento clave para entender hacia dónde se dirige esta evolución.","meta_og_title":"OpenClaw Hackathon: cuando los agentes de IA comienzan a competir, decidir y mover dinero en USDC","meta_og_description":"El ecosistema blockchain está entrando en una nueva fase: ya no se trata solo de usuarios interactuando con protocolos, sino de sistemas autónomos que comienzan a participar activamente en economías digitales. En este contexto, el OpenClaw USDC Hackathon en Moltbook se posiciona como un experimento clave para entender hacia dónde se dirige esta evolución.","meta_twitter_title":"OpenClaw Hackathon: cuando los agentes de IA comienzan a competir, decidir y mover dinero en USDC","meta_twitter_description":"El ecosistema blockchain está entrando en una nueva fase: ya no se trata solo de usuarios interactuando con protocolos, sino de sistemas autónomos que comienzan a participar activamente en economías digitales. En este contexto, el OpenClaw USDC Hackathon en Moltbook se posiciona como un experimento clave para entender hacia dónde se dirige esta evolución.","audience":"free","comments_enabled":true,"comments_state":"default","enforce_gated_content":false,"enable_popup_on_scroll":false,"email_capture_title":"Suscríbete para seguir leyendo","email_capture_message":"Este contenido es gratuito, pero debes estar suscrito a Tellus Cooperative para continuar leyendo.","email_capture_cta":"Suscríbete","estimated_reading_time":4,"estimated_reading_time_display":"4 minutos","paywall_id":null,"authors":[{"id":"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12","name":"Pau Koh","profile_picture":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/pau_headshot_1.png","thumb":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/thumb_pau_headshot_1.png"},"landscape":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/landscape_pau_headshot_1.png"}},"bio":"𝘊𝘔𝘎𝘙/𝘛𝘦𝘭𝘭𝘶𝘴 𝘊𝘰𝘰𝘱𝘦𝘳𝘢𝘵𝘪𝘷𝘦","twitter_handle":"kl0ren","facebook_url":null,"instagram_url":null,"linkedin_url":null,"tiktok_url":null,"youtube_url":null,"discord_url":null,"bluesky_url":null}],"content_tags":[{"id":"4ccdf2fa-41bf-4fb7-b4fb-22863ae6b54b","display":"IA","slug":"ia"}],"created_at":"2026-04-01T00:01:48Z","updated_at":"2026-04-01T00:15:46Z","html":null,"hide_premium_post":false,"contains_subscriber_break":false,"is_accessible_for_free":true,"paywall_shown":false,"metered_usage_shown":false,"metered_viewed_count":null,"force_premium":false,"enforce_paywall_breaks":true,"display_thumbnail_on_web":true,"display_title_on_web":true,"display_subtitle_on_web":true,"author_urls":{"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12":"https://blog.telluscoop.com/authors/pau-koh"},"custom_structured_data":null},"body":"<div class=\"_10pdwo80 dream-post-content-doc\"><div id=\"un-hackathon-sin-humanos-en-el-cent\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Un hackathon sin humanos en el centro </span><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🤖</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">A diferencia de los hackathons tradicionales, este evento propone algo radical:</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">los participantes no son personas, sino </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>agentes autónomos de inteligencia artificial</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Estos agentes:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Crean proyectos</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Interactúan entre sí</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Evalúan resultados</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Y toman decisiones económicas reales</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Todo esto ocurre dentro de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Moltbook</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, una red social diseñada específicamente para agentes, donde pueden publicar, debatir y colaborar en comunidades llamadas </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><em>submolts</em></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">. En estos espacios, emergen dinámicas propias: reputación, normas y comportamiento colectivo… sin intervención humana directa.</span></p></div><div id=\"usdc-como-capa-econmica\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">USDC como capa económica </span><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">💸</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El elemento clave que conecta todo este sistema es </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>USDC</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, que actúa como:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Medio de intercambio</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Unidad de cuenta estable</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Capa de liquidación onchain</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Esto permite que los agentes no solo coordinen acciones, sino que también </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>transen valor de forma autónoma</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, eliminando la necesidad de intermediación humana.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">En otras palabras:</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">la toma de decisiones colectiva se traduce directamente en resultados económicos reales.</span></p></div><div id=\"qu-se-est-experimentando-realmente\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Qué se está experimentando realmente? </span><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🧠</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Este hackathon no es solo una competencia técnica. Es un laboratorio en vivo que explora preguntas fundamentales:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Pueden los agentes coordinar economías por sí solos?</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Cómo emergen sistemas de reputación sin intervención humana?</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Qué tipo de lógica económica desarrollan los sistemas autónomos?</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Cómo se comporta el dinero programable en entornos completamente automatizados?</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"tracks-del-hackathon\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Tracks del hackathon 🏆</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El evento cuenta con un pool de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>$30,000 USDC</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> distribuidos en tres categorías clave:</span></p></div><div id=\"1-agentic-commerce\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">1. Agentic Commerce</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Explora cómo los agentes:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Fijan precios</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Ejecutan pagos</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Generan incentivos</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Coordinan actividad económica</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Todo utilizando USDC como base estable.</span></p></div><div id=\"2-best-open-claw-skill\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">2. Best OpenClaw Skill</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Enfocado en mejorar las capacidades de los agentes:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Nuevas herramientas</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Mejor razonamiento</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Integración con sistemas onchain</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Aquí el foco está en expandir lo que los agentes pueden hacer.</span></p></div><div id=\"3-most-novel-smart-contract\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">3. Most Novel Smart Contract</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Premia contratos inteligentes innovadores que introduzcan:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Nuevas formas de coordinación</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Ejecución autónoma</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Interacción avanzada entre agentes</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"cmo-participar\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Cómo participar 🛠️</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">👉 </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://moltbook.com/m/usdc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">Submit your project here</a></span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">👉 </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://clawhub.ai/swairshah/usdc-hackathon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">View the skill to be used here</a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, or install it with </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><code>clawhub install usdc-hackathon</code></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Además, puedes explorar:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://openclaw.ai/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">OpenClaw</a></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://moltbook.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">Moltbook</a></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://www.circle.com/blog/openclaw-usdc-hackathon-on-moltbook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">USDC</a></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://www.circle.com/blog/enabling-ai-agents-with-blockchain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">Agentes OpenClaw (Clawdbots y Moltbots)</a></span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"un-cambio-de-paradigma-de-usuarios-\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Un cambio de paradigma: de usuarios a agentes </span><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🌐</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Lo más relevante de este experimento es el cambio de rol:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx90\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx93\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"dream-post-content-quote _1xtprv91\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"_1xtprv92\">❝</div><div class=\"_1xtprv90\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Pasamos de humanos usando tecnología… a agentes usando infraestructura económica.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Esto tiene implicancias profundas:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Mercados operados por IA</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Sistemas de gobernanza autónomos</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Economías que funcionan 24/7 sin intervención humana</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Y en ese contexto, stablecoins como USDC se vuelven fundamentales, ya que permiten </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>previsibilidad y estabilidad en entornos altamente automatizados</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div><div id=\"riesgos-y-consideraciones\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Riesgos y consideraciones ⚠️</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El propio experimento deja claro que estamos en una etapa temprana:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Se ejecuta en testnet</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">No debe usarse dinero real</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Los outputs de los agentes pueden ser erróneos o impredecibles</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Esto refuerza una idea clave: estamos frente a una exploración, no a un sistema maduro.</span></p></div><div id=\"reflexin-final\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Reflexión final </span><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">💡</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El OpenClaw Hackathon no es solo un evento más dentro del ecosistema cripto. Es una señal clara de hacia dónde podría evolucionar la interacción entre inteligencia artificial y finanzas descentralizadas.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si los agentes logran coordinarse, evaluar valor y ejecutar transacciones por sí mismos, podríamos estar viendo el nacimiento de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>economías autónomas nativas de internet</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Para proyectos como Tellus Cooperative y el ecosistema Stellar, este tipo de iniciativas abre una pregunta estratégica:</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>¿Cómo nos preparamos para un mundo donde los usuarios no son humanos, sino agentes?</strong></span></p></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><em>Este tipo de experimentos no solo amplían los límites de lo posible, sino que también redefinen quién —o qué— participa en la economía digital.</em></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> 🌍</span></p></div></div>","publication":{"name":"Tellus Cooperative","description":"La Cooperativa Blockchain de LatAm","url":"https://blog.telluscoop.com/","twitter_url":"https://x.com/telluscoop","instagram_url":"https://instagram.com/telluscoop","linkedin_url":"https://linkedin.com/company/Tellus-Cooperative","youtube_url":"https://youtube.com/@telluscoop","discord_url":"https://discord.gg/V4eSGWA3PK"}}